gin="00:40.326" end="00:40.566">る</span><span begin="00:40.566" end="00:40.859">軽</span><span begin="00:40.859" end="00:41.373">口</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">随口甩出的玩笑话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tatakeru karukuchi</span></p><p begin="00:41.735" end="00:43.445" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:41.735" end="00:42.013">い</span><span begin="00:42.013" end="00:42.246">き</span><span begin="00:42.246" end="00:42.493">お</span><span begin="00:42.493" end="00:42.726">い</span><span begin="00:42.726" end="00:42.959">の</span><span begin="00:42.959" end="00:43.300">権</span><span begin="00:43.300" end="00:43.445">化</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">气势的化身</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ikioi no gonge</span></p><p begin="00:43.706" end="00:45.395" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:43.706" end="00:43.940">ぶ</span><span begin="00:43.940" end="00:44.173">つ</span><span begin="00:44.173" end="00:44.401">け</span><span begin="00:44.401" end="00:44.666">ら</span><span begin="00:44.666" end="00:44.913">れ</span><span begin="00:44.913" end="00:45.227">挑</span><span begin="00:45.227" end="00:45.395">戦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">劈头砸来的挑战</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">butsukerare chousen</span></p><p begin="00:45.478" end="00:47.166" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:45.478" end="00:45.731">た</span><span begin="00:45.731" end="00:45.983">た</span><span begin="00:45.983" end="00:46.182">か</span><span begin="00:46.182" end="00:46.448">え</span><span begin="00:46.448" end="00:46.695">る</span><span begin="00:46.695" end="00:46.981">意</span><span begin="00:46.981" end="00:47.166">見</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">针锋相对的意见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tatakaeru iken</span></p><p begin="00:47.584" end="00:49.213" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:47.584" end="00:47.836">手</span><span begin="00:47.836" end="00:48.083">の</span><span begin="00:48.083" end="00:48.335">込</span><span begin="00:48.335" end="00:48.549">ん</span><span begin="00:48.549" end="00:48.801">だ</span><span begin="00:48.801" end="00:48.980">論</span><span begin="00:48.980" end="00:49.213">駁</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">精心构筑的反驳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">te no konda ronbaku</span></p><p begin="00:49.464" end="00:51.238" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:49.464" end="00:49.769">手</span><span begin="00:49.769" end="00:49.983">が</span><span begin="00:49.983" end="00:50.235">出</span><span begin="00:50.235" end="00:50.487">る</span><span begin="00:50.487" end="00:50.734">が</span><span begin="00:50.734" end="00:51.093">早</span><span begin="00:51.093" end="00:51.238">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">——然而动手比动嘴更快</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">te ga deru ga hayai</span></p><p begin="00:51.462" end="00:53.192" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:51.462" end="00:51.727">こ</span><span begin="00:51.727" end="00:51.991">う</span><span begin="00:51.991" end="00:52.256">な</span><span begin="00:52.256" end="00:52.507">っ</span><span begin="00:52.507" end="00:52.623">た</span><span begin="00:52.623" end="00:52.776">ら</span><span begin="00:52.776" end="00:53.009">い</span><span begin="00:53.009" end="00:53.108">つ</span><span begin="00:53.108" end="00:53.192">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每到这种时候就老样子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kou nattara itsumo</span></p><p begin="00:53.437" end="00:55.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:53.437" end="00:53.701">ま</span><span begin="00:53.701" end="00:53.935">る</span><span begin="00:53.935" end="00:54.199">で</span><span begin="00:54.199" end="00:54.428">気</span><span begin="00:54.428" end="00:54.661">が</span><span begin="00:54.661" end="00:54.845">利</span><span begin="00:54.845" end="00:54.980">か</span><span begin="00:54.980" end="00:55.083">な</span><span begin="00:55.083" end="00:55.150">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">完全不懂察言观色</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">marude ki ga kikanai</span></p><p begin="00:55.384" end="00:56.985" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:55.384" end="00:55.649">ま</span><span begin="00:55.649" end="00:55.878">っ</span><span begin="00:55.878" end="00:56.111">す</span><span begin="00:56.111" end="00:56.425">ぐ</span><span begin="00:56.425" end="00:56.671">火</span><span begin="00:56.671" end="00:56.887">力</span><span begin="00:56.887" end="00:56.985">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一味靠火力硬上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">massugu karyoku de</span></p><p begin="00:57.343" end="00:58.955" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:57.343" end="00:57.600">と</span><span begin="00:57.600" end="00:57.840">に</span><span begin="00:57.840" end="00:58.084">か</span><span begin="00:58.084" end="00:58.307">く</span><span begin="00:58.307" end="00:58.516">速</span><span begin="00:58.516" end="00:58.804">度</span><span begin="00:58.804" end="00:58.955">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总之用速度说话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tonikaku sokudo de</span></p><p begin="00:59.278" end="01:01.028" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:59.278" end="00:59.523">ま</span><span begin="00:59.523" end="00:59.780">あ</span><span begin="00:59.780" end="00:59.893">負</span><span begin="00:59.893" end="01:00.012">け</span><span begin="01:00.012" end="01:00.300">な</span><span begin="01:00.300" end="01:00.478">い</span><span begin="01:00.478" end="01:00.701">け</span><span begin="01:00.701" end="01:00.832">ど</span><span begin="01:00.832" end="01:01.028">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘛，反正我也不会输就是了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">maa makenai kedo ne</span></p><p begin="01:01.260" end="01:02.931" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:01.260" end="01:01.487">つ</span><span begin="01:01.487" end="01:01.697">い</span><span begin="01:01.697" end="01:01.954">で</span><span begin="01:01.954" end="01:02.194">に</span><span begin="01:02.194" end="01:02.452">決</span><span begin="01:02.452" end="01:02.644">め</span><span begin="01:02.644" end="01:02.761">ち</span><span begin="01:02.761" end="01:02.844">ゃ</span><span begin="01:02.844" end="01:02.931">え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">顺便把事情了结掉吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tsuide ni kimechae</span></p><p begin="01:03.205" end="01:04.815" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:03.205" end="01:03.681">今</span><span begin="01:03.681" end="01:03.907">夜</span><span begin="01:03.907" end="01:04.130">の</span><span begin="01:04.130" end="01:04.388">い</span><span begin="01:04.388" end="01:04.615">ろ</span><span begin="01:04.615" end="01:04.715">い</span><span begin="01:04.715" end="01:04.815">ろ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今晚的种种——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kon'ya no iroiro</span></p><p begin="01:05.112" end="01:06.835" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:05.112" end="01:05.387">い</span><span begin="01:05.387" end="01:05.640">ろ</span><span begin="01:05.640" end="01:05.868">い</span><span begin="01:05.868" end="01:06.094">ろ</span><span begin="01:06.094" end="01:06.208">っ</span><span begin="01:06.208" end="01:06.310">て</span><span begin="01:06.310" end="01:06.426">な</span><span begin="01:06.426" end="01:06.605">ん</span><span begin="01:06.605" end="01:06.797">だ</span><span begin="01:06.797" end="01:06.835">ろ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">……种种是指什么呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">iroiro tte nandaro</span></p><p begin="01:07.070" end="01:08.318" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16" amll:connect-next="true"><span begin="01:07.070" end="01:07.545">曖</span><span begin="01:07.545" end="01:08.112">昧</span><span begin="01:08.112" end="01:08.452">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">暧昧的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">aimai de</span></p><p begin="01:08.318" end="01:09.753" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:08.318" end="01:08.515">い</span><span begin="01:08.807" end="01:09.043">い</span><span begin="01:09.043" end="01:09.280">加</span><span begin="01:09.280" end="01:09.516">減</span><span begin="01:09.516" end="01:09.753">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">敷衍的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">iikagen na</span></p><p begin="01:10.131" end="01:11.139" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:10.131" end="01:10.383">幻</span><span begin="01:10.383" end="01:10.635">想</span><span begin="01:10.635" end="01:10.887">な</span><span begin="01:10.887" end="01:11.139">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果只是幻想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">gensou nara</span></p><p begin="01:11.739" end="01:13.627" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:11.739" end="01:12.044">き</span><span begin="01:12.044" end="01:12.331">ま</span><span begin="01:12.331" end="01:12.631">り</span><span begin="01:12.631" end="01:13.004">ご</span><span begin="01:13.004" end="01:13.272">と</span><span begin="01:13.272" end="01:13.627">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就不靠什么规矩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimarigoto de</span></p><p begin="01:13.731" end="01:14.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:13.731" end="01:13.969">た</span><span begin="01:13.969" end="01:14.207">よ</span><span begin="01:14.207" end="01:14.444">ら</span><span begin="01:14.444" end="01:14.682">な</span><span begin="01:14.682" end="01:14.920">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也不去依赖</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tayoranai</span></p><p begin="01:15.074" end="01:22.854" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:15.074" end="01:15.346">そ</span><span begin="01:15.346" end="01:15.685">れ</span><span begin="01:15.685" end="01:15.951">で</span><span begin="01:15.951" end="01:16.305">も</span><span begin="01:16.305" end="01:16.678">す</span><span begin="01:16.678" end="01:16.945">こ</span><span begin="01:16.945" end="01:17.285">し</span><span begin="01:17.285" end="01:17.605">ず</span><span begin="01:17.605" end="01:17.871">つ</span><span begin="01:17.871" end="01:18.079">当</span><span begin="01:18.079" end="01:18.418">た</span><span begin="01:18.418" end="01:18.988">り</span><span begin="01:18.988" end="01:19.463">前</span><span begin="01:19.463" end="01:20.006">を</span><span begin="01:20.006" end="01:20.224">積</span><span begin="01:20.224" end="01:20.456">み</span><span begin="01:20.456" end="01:20.788">上</span><span begin="01:20.788" end="01:21.150">げ</span><span begin="01:21.150" end="01:21.383">て</span><span begin="01:21.383" end="01:21.695">い</span><span begin="01:21.695" end="01:22.854">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此，还是一点一点地积累着理所当然</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">soredemo sukoshi zutsu atarimae o tsumiageteyuku</span></p><p begin="01:23.624" end="01:26.242" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:23.624" end="01:23.823">そ</span><span begin="01:23.823" end="01:24.021">れ</span><span begin="01:24.021" end="01:24.273">は</span><span begin="01:24.273" end="01:24.652">き</span><span begin="01:24.652" end="01:24.856">っ</span><span begin="01:24.856" end="01:26.242">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那一定是</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sore wa kitto</span></p><p begin="01:26.574" end="01:30.331" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:26.574" end="01:27.175">不</span><span begin="01:27.175" end="01:27.529">思</span><span begin="01:27.529" end="01:27.796">議</span><span begin="01:27.796" end="01:28.237">で</span><span begin="01:28.237" end="01:28.630">も</span><span begin="01:28.630" end="01:28.916">な</span><span begin="01:28.916" end="01:30.331">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并不不可思议的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">fushigi demo nai</span></p><p begin="01:30.658" end="01:33.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:30.658" end="01:31.015">何</span><span begin="01:31.015" end="01:31.349">も</span><span begin="01:31.349" end="01:31.601">変</span><span begin="01:31.601" end="01:31.941">わ</span><span begin="01:31.941" end="01:32.328">ら</span><span begin="01:32.328" end="01:32.561">な</span><span begin="01:32.561" end="01:33.860">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">什么都没有改变的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nani mo kawaranai</span></p><p begin="01:34.071" end="01:39.680" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:34.071" end="01:34.430">い</span><span begin="01:34.430" end="01:34.711">つ</span><span begin="01:34.711" end="01:35.104">も</span><span begin="01:35.104" end="01:35.477">通</span><span begin="01:35.477" end="01:35.724">り</span><span begin="01:35.724" end="01:36.272">の</span><span begin="01:36.272" end="01:36.456">あ</span><span begin="01:36.456" end="01:36.689">り</span><span begin="01:36.689" end="01:37.358">ふ</span><span begin="01:37.358" end="01:37.591">れ</span><span begin="01:37.591" end="01:38.013">た</span><span begin="01:38.013" end="01:38.594">景</span><span begin="01:38.594" end="01:38.988">色</span><span begin="01:38.988" end="01:39.375">の</span><span begin="01:39.375" end="01:39.680">中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一如往常的、平凡至极的景色之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itsumo doori no arifureta keshiki no naka</span></p><p begin="01:40.137" end="01:45.922" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:40.137" end="01:40.337">で</span><span begin="01:40.337" end="01:40.604">も</span><span begin="01:40.604" end="01:42.285">ね</span><span begin="01:42.285" end="01:42.727">不</span><span begin="01:42.727" end="01:43.115">思</span><span begin="01:43.115" end="01:43.455">議</span><span begin="01:43.455" end="01:43.829">な</span><span begin="01:43.829" end="01:44.235">も</span><span begin="01:44.235" end="01:44.570">の</span><span begin="01:44.570" end="01:45.922">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是呢，说来也奇妙</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">demo ne fushigi na mono ne</span></p><p begin="01:46.118" end="01:49.402" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:46.118" end="01:46.333">振</span><span begin="01:46.333" end="01:46.619">り</span><span begin="01:46.619" end="01:46.997">返</span><span begin="01:46.997" end="01:47.200">っ</span><span begin="01:47.200" end="01:47.555">て</span><span begin="01:47.555" end="01:47.909">み</span><span begin="01:47.909" end="01:48.161">れ</span><span begin="01:48.161" end="01:49.402">ば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回头看看的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">furikaette mireba</span></p><p begin="01:49.589" end="01:57.933" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:49.589" end="01:49.997">い</span><span begin="01:49.997" end="01:50.282">つ</span><span begin="01:50.282" end="01:50.709">の</span><span begin="01:50.709" end="01:51.082">間</span><span begin="01:51.082" end="01:51.329">に</span><span begin="01:51.329" end="01:51.825">か</span><span begin="01:51.825" end="01:52.043">ちょ</span><span begin="01:52.043" end="01:52.310">っ</span><span begin="01:52.310" end="01:53.027">と</span><span begin="01:53.027" end="01:53.245">だ</span><span begin="01:53.245" end="01:53.619">け</span><span begin="01:53.619" end="01:54.220">狭</span><span begin="01:54.220" end="01:54.714">く</span><span begin="01:54.714" end="01:55.045">な</span><span begin="01:55.045" end="01:55.223">っ</span><span begin="01:55.223" end="01:55.790">た…</span><span begin="01:55.790" end="01:55.950">か</span><span begin="01:55.950" end="01:56.237">も</span><span begin="01:56.237" end="01:57.933">ね。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知不觉间，距离似乎稍微变近了一些……也许吧。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itsu no ma ni ka chotto dake semaku natta... kamo ne.</span></p><p begin="01:58.901" end="02:02.946" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:58.901" end="01:59.115">何</span><span begin="01:59.115" end="01:59.604">も</span><span begin="01:59.604" end="02:00.012">約</span><span begin="02:00.012" end="02:00.519">束</span><span begin="02:00.519" end="02:00.847">す</span><span begin="02:00.847" end="02:01.223">る</span><span begin="02:01.223" end="02:01.456">こ</span><span begin="02:01.456" end="02:01.690">と</span><span begin="02:01.690" end="02:01.937">な</span><span begin="02:01.937" end="02:02.152">ん</span><span begin="02:02.152" end="02:02.304">て</span><span begin="02:02.304" end="02:02.519">な</span><span begin="02:02.519" end="02:02.946">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有任何需要约定的事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nani mo yakusoku suru koto nante nai</span></p><p begin="02:04.005" end="02:06.948" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:04.005" end="02:04.277">ひ</span><span begin="02:04.277" end="02:04.490">と</span><span begin="02:04.490" end="02:04.750">こ</span><span begin="02:04.750" end="02:04.975">と</span><span begin="02:04.975" end="02:05.397">だ</span><span begin="02:05.397" end="02:05.624">っ</span><span begin="02:05.624" end="02:05.930">て</span><span begin="02:05.930" end="02:06.177">必</span><span begin="02:06.177" end="02:06.410">要</span><span begin="02:06.410" end="02:06.785">な</span><span begin="02:06.785" end="02:06.948">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一句话都不必多说</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hitokoto datte hitsuyou nai</span></p><p begin="02:07.180" end="02:11.273" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:07.180" end="02:07.427">あ</span><span begin="02:07.427" end="02:07.558">ん</span><span begin="02:07.558" end="02:07.669">た</span><span begin="02:07.669" end="02:07.936">は</span><span begin="02:07.936" end="02:08.172">ま</span><span begin="02:08.172" end="02:08.402">た</span><span begin="02:08.402" end="02:08.862">明</span><span begin="02:08.862" end="02:09.202">日</span><span begin="02:09.202" end="02:09.576">も</span><span begin="02:09.576" end="02:09.770">や</span><span begin="02:09.770" end="02:09.875">っ</span><span begin="02:09.875" end="02:10.370">て</span><span begin="02:10.370" end="02:10.603">く</span><span begin="02:10.603" end="02:11.273">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你明天又会照常跑来的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">anta wa mata ashita mo yattekuru</span></p><p begin="02:11.611" end="02:14.646" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:11.611" end="02:11.863">そ</span><span begin="02:11.863" end="02:12.095">う</span><span begin="02:12.095" end="02:12.362">い</span><span begin="02:12.362" end="02:12.595">う</span><span begin="02:12.595" end="02:12.937">こ</span><span begin="02:12.937" end="02:13.308">と</span><span begin="02:13.308" end="02:13.574">に</span><span begin="02:13.574" end="02:13.861">な</span><span begin="02:13.861" end="02:14.015">っ</span><span begin="02:14.015" end="02:14.268">て</span><span begin="02:14.268" end="02:14.413">い</span><span begin="02:14.413" end="02:14.646">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就是这么回事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sou iu koto ni natte iru</span></p><p begin="02:14.787" end="02:15.450" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="02:14.787" end="02:15.039">そ</span><span begin="02:15.039" end="02:15.150">う</span><span begin="02:15.150" end="02:15.258">で</span><span begin="02:15.258" end="02:15.354">しょ</span><span begin="02:15.354" end="02:15.450">う？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">——对吧？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sou deshou?</span></p><p begin="02:33.314" end="02:34.817" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="02:33.314" end="02:33.478">い</span><span begin="02:33.478" end="02:33.658">つ</span><span begin="02:33.658" end="02:33.857">か</span><span begin="02:33.857" end="02:34.055">ら</span><span begin="02:34.055" end="02:34.220">こ</span><span begin="02:34.220" end="02:34.385">う</span><span begin="02:34.385" end="02:34.478">し</span><span begin="02:34.478" end="02:34.817">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从何时起就这样了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itsu kara kou shite</span></p><p begin="02:34.821" end="02:36.619" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="02:34.821" end="02:35.077">い</span><span begin="02:35.077" end="02:35.272">つ</span><span begin="02:35.272" end="02:35.510">ま</span><span begin="02:35.510" end="02:35.756">で</span><span begin="02:35.756" end="02:35.989">こ</span><span begin="02:35.989" end="02:36.223">う</span><span begin="02:36.223" end="02:36.368">し</span><span begin="02:36.368" end="02:36.619">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又要这样到何时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itsu made kou shite</span></p><p begin="02:36.787" end="02:38.506" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="02:36.787" end="02:36.859">そ</span><span begin="02:36.859" end="02:37.313">ん</span><span begin="02:37.313" end="02:37.512">な</span><span begin="02:37.512" end="02:37.745">の</span><span begin="02:37.745" end="02:37.963">ど</span><span begin="02:37.963" end="02:38.195">う</span><span begin="02:38.195" end="02:38.375">し</span><span begin="02:38.375" end="02:38.506">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这种事为什么——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sonna no doushite</span></p><p begin="02:38.731" end="02:40.263" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="02:38.731" end="02:39.019">問</span><span begin="02:39.019" end="02:39.218">え</span><span begin="02:39.218" end="02:39.417">な</span><span begin="02:39.417" end="02:39.717">い</span><span begin="02:39.717" end="02:39.951">関</span><span begin="02:39.951" end="02:40.263">係</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是无法开口去问的关系</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">toenai kankei</span></p><p begin="02:40.606" end="02:42.571" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="02:40.606" end="02:40.873">勝</span><span begin="02:40.873" end="02:41.315">利</span><span begin="02:41.315" end="02:41.586">者</span> <span begin="02:41.586" end="02:41.867">負</span><span begin="02:41.867" end="02:42.099">け</span><span begin="02:42.099" end="02:42.571">犬</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">胜者与败犬</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shourisha makeinu</span></p><p begin="02:42.574" end="02:44.343" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="02:42.574" end="02:43.112">休</span><span begin="02:43.112" end="02:43.306">ま</span><span begin="02:43.306" end="02:43.524">せ</span><span begin="02:43.524" end="02:43.790">休</span><span begin="02:43.790" end="02:44.023">ま</span><span begin="02:44.023" end="02:44.135">さ</span><span begin="02:44.135" end="02:44.343">れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让人歇、被人拦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yasumase yasumasare</span></p><p begin="02:44.820" end="02:46.352" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="02:44.820" end="02:45.213">夜</span><span begin="02:45.213" end="02:45.480">を</span><span begin="02:45.480" end="02:45.698">駆</span><span begin="02:45.698" end="02:45.930">け</span><span begin="02:45.930" end="02:46.130">た</span><span begin="02:46.130" end="02:46.255">な</span><span begin="02:46.255" end="02:46.352">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若奔驰过夜晚的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yoru o kaketanara</span></p><p begin="02:46.688" end="02:48.254" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="02:46.688" end="02:46.921">ま</span><span begin="02:46.921" end="02:47.192">た</span><span begin="02:47.192" end="02:47.424">日</span><span begin="02:47.424" end="02:47.576">だ</span><span begin="02:47.576" end="02:47.658">っ</span><span begin="02:47.658" end="02:47.856">て</span><span begin="02:47.856" end="02:48.088">昇</span><span begin="02:48.088" end="02:48.254">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">太阳也自然会再升起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mata hi datte noboru</span></p><p begin="02:48.510" end="02:50.085" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42"><span begin="02:48.510" end="02:48.883">意</span><span begin="02:48.883" end="02:49.048">味</span><span begin="02:49.048" end="02:49.246">な</span><span begin="02:49.246" end="02:49.426">し</span><span begin="02:49.426" end="02:49.678">の</span><span begin="02:49.678" end="02:49.893">視</span><span begin="02:49.893" end="02:50.085">線</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毫无意义的视线</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">imi nashi no shisen</span></p><p begin="02:50.363" end="02:52.103" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43"><span begin="02:50.363" end="02:50.649">な</span><span begin="02:50.649" end="02:50.867">に</span><span begin="02:50.867" end="02:51.133">げ</span><span begin="02:51.133" end="02:51.347">な</span><span begin="02:51.347" end="02:51.619">い</span><span begin="02:51.619" end="02:51.813">笑</span><span begin="02:51.813" end="02:52.103">顔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">漫不经心的笑容</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nanigenai egao</span></p><p begin="02:52.332" end="02:53.908" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44"><span begin="02:52.332" end="02:52.584">た</span><span begin="02:52.584" end="02:52.778">た</span><span begin="02:52.778" end="02:53.030">け</span><span begin="02:53.030" end="02:53.335">る</span><span begin="02:53.335" end="02:53.515">軽</span><span begin="02:53.515" end="02:53.908">口</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">随口甩出的玩笑话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tatakeru karukuchi</span></p><p begin="02:54.201" end="02:56.029" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45"><span begin="02:54.201" end="02:54.560">い</span><span begin="02:54.560" end="02:54.773">き</span><span begin="02:54.773" end="02:55.006">お</span><span begin="02:55.006" end="02:55.257">い</span><span begin="02:55.257" end="02:55.543">の</span><span begin="02:55.543" end="02:55.844">権</span><span begin="02:55.844" end="02:56.029">化</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">气势的化身</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ikioi no gonge</span></p><p begin="02:56.248" end="02:58.003" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46"><span begin="02:56.248" end="02:56.514">ぶ</span><span begin="02:56.514" end="02:56.747">つ</span><span begin="02:56.747" end="02:56.999">け</span><span begin="02:56.999" end="02:57.213">ら</span><span begin="02:57.213" end="02:57.431">れ</span><span begin="02:57.431" end="02:57.697">挑</span><span begin="02:57.697" end="02:58.003">戦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">劈头砸来的挑战</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">butsukerare chousen</span></p><p begin="02:58.273" end="02:59.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47"><span begin="02:58.273" end="02:58.544">た</span><span begin="02:58.544" end="02:58.724">た</span><span begin="02:58.724" end="02:58.938">か</span><span begin="02:58.938" end="02:59.155">え</span><span begin="02:59.155" end="02:59.408">る</span><span begin="02:59.408" end="02:59.674">意</span><span begin="02:59.674" end="02:59.980">見</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">针锋相对的意见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tatakaeru iken</span></p><p begin="03:00.168" end="03:02.601" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48" amll:connect-next="true"><span begin="03:00.168" end="03:00.440">手</span><span begin="03:00.440" end="03:00.672">の</span><span begin="03:00.672" end="03:00.886">込</span><span begin="03:00.886" end="03:01.172">ん</span><span begin="03:01.172" end="03:01.390">だ</span><span begin="03:01.390" end="03:01.705">論</span><span begin="03:01.705" end="03:02.078">駁</span> <span begin="03:02.078" end="03:02.224">の</span><span begin="03:02.224" end="03:02.354">前</span><span begin="03:02.354" end="03:02.601">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">精心构筑的反驳——之前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">te no konda ronbaku no mae ni</span></p><p begin="03:02.601" end="03:19.987" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49" amll:connect-next="true"><span begin="03:02.601" end="03:02.853">今</span><span begin="03:02.853" end="03:03.081">度</span><span begin="03:03.081" end="03:03.333">は</span><span begin="03:03.333" end="03:03.551">わ</span><span begin="03:03.551" end="03:03.682">た</span><span begin="03:03.682" end="03:04.016">し</span><span begin="03:04.016" end="03:04.302">が</span><span begin="03:04.302" end="03:04.608">手</span><span begin="03:04.608" end="03:05.029">を</span><span begin="03:05.029" end="03:05.262">出</span><span begin="03:05.262" end="03:07.502">す！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这次轮到我先出手了！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kondo wa watashi ga te o dasu!</span></p><p begin="03:19.987" end="03:21.848" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50"><span begin="03:19.987" end="03:20.554">大</span><span begin="03:20.554" end="03:20.875">切</span><span begin="03:20.875" end="03:21.213">な</span><span begin="03:21.213" end="03:21.568">も</span><span begin="03:21.568" end="03:21.766">の</span><span begin="03:21.766" end="03:21.848">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">重要的东西</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">taisetsu na mono wa</span></p><p begin="03:22.255" end="03:23.755" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51"><span begin="03:22.255" end="03:22.609">言</span><span begin="03:22.609" end="03:22.862">葉</span><span begin="03:22.862" end="03:23.095">じゃ</span><span begin="03:23.095" end="03:23.327">な</span><span begin="03:23.327" end="03:23.526">く</span><span begin="03:23.526" end="03:23.755">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不是言语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kotoba ja nakute</span></p><p begin="03:24.141" end="03:25.527" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52"><span begin="03:24.141" end="03:24.462">言</span><span begin="03:24.462" end="03:25.145">葉</span><span begin="03:25.145" end="03:25.465">よ</span><span begin="03:25.465" end="03:25.527">り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而是比言语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kotoba yori</span></p><p begin="03:25.745" end="03:27.742" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53"><span begin="03:25.745" end="03:26.133">不</span><span begin="03:26.133" end="03:26.455">確</span><span begin="03:26.455" end="03:26.705">か</span><span begin="03:26.705" end="03:26.938">な</span><span begin="03:26.938" end="03:27.243">も</span><span begin="03:27.243" end="03:27.457">の</span><span begin="03:27.457" end="03:27.742">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">更不确定的什么</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">futashika na mono de</span></p><p begin="03:28.089" end="03:31.783" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54"><span begin="03:28.089" end="03:28.410">代</span><span begin="03:28.410" end="03:28.681">わ</span><span begin="03:28.681" end="03:29.049">り</span><span begin="03:29.049" end="03:29.389">に</span><span begin="03:29.389" end="03:29.655">置</span><span begin="03:29.655" end="03:29.975">き</span><span begin="03:29.975" end="03:30.295">置</span><span begin="03:30.295" end="03:30.460">い</span><span begin="03:30.460" end="03:30.659">て</span><span begin="03:30.659" end="03:31.013">か</span><span begin="03:31.013" end="03:31.394">れ</span><span begin="03:31.394" end="03:31.605">て</span><span begin="03:31.605" end="03:31.783">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被一件件留置在此、取而代之的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kawari ni okioite kareteku</span></p><p begin="03:32.067" end="03:35.524" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55"><span begin="03:32.067" end="03:32.580">幻</span><span begin="03:32.580" end="03:33.787">想</span><span begin="03:33.787" end="03:34.074">の</span><span begin="03:34.074" end="03:34.321">お</span><span begin="03:34.321" end="03:34.452">も</span><span begin="03:34.452" end="03:35.524">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是幻想的重量</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">gensou no omosa</span></p><p begin="03:36.409" end="03:38.943" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56"><span begin="03:36.409" end="03:37.033">空</span><span begin="03:37.033" end="03:37.224">の</span><span begin="03:37.224" end="03:37.479">む</span><span begin="03:37.479" end="03:37.757">こ</span><span begin="03:37.757" end="03:38.943">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天空的那一边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sora no mukou</span></p><p begin="03:39.137" end="03:42.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57"><span begin="03:39.137" end="03:39.457">不</span><span begin="03:39.457" end="03:40.000">思</span><span begin="03:40.000" end="03:40.479">議</span><span begin="03:40.479" end="03:40.732">で</span><span begin="03:40.732" end="03:41.052">も</span><span begin="03:41.052" end="03:41.333">な</span><span begin="03:41.333" end="03:42.740">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并不不可思议</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">fushigi demo nai</span></p><p begin="03:43.068" end="03:46.256" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58"><span begin="03:43.068" end="03:43.321">影</span><span begin="03:43.321" end="03:43.679">ひ</span><span begin="03:43.679" end="03:44.048">と</span><span begin="03:44.048" end="03:44.280">つ</span><span begin="03:44.280" end="03:44.601">も</span><span begin="03:44.601" end="03:44.993">な</span><span begin="03:44.993" end="03:46.256">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连一道影子都没有的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kage hitotsu mo nai</span></p><p begin="03:46.474" end="03:52.155" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59"><span begin="03:46.474" end="03:46.739">き</span><span begin="03:46.739" end="03:46.881">っ</span><span begin="03:46.881" end="03:47.202">と</span><span begin="03:47.202" end="03:47.560">退</span><span begin="03:47.560" end="03:47.929">屈</span><span begin="03:47.929" end="03:48.704">で</span><span begin="03:48.704" end="03:49.013">ず</span><span begin="03:49.013" end="03:49.179">っ</span><span begin="03:49.179" end="03:49.902">と</span><span begin="03:49.902" end="03:50.149">静</span><span begin="03:50.149" end="03:50.523">か</span><span begin="03:50.523" end="03:50.876">な</span><span begin="03:50.876" end="03:51.128">毎</span><span begin="03:51.128" end="03:52.155">日</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定是无聊的、一直安静的每一天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kitto taikutsu de zutto shizuka na mainichi</span></p><p begin="03:52.200" end="03:58.369" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60"><span begin="03:52.200" end="03:52.857">で</span><span begin="03:52.857" end="03:53.070">も</span><span begin="03:53.070" end="03:54.801">ね</span><span begin="03:54.801" end="03:55.246">不</span><span begin="03:55.246" end="03:55.635">思</span><span begin="03:55.635" end="03:55.935">議</span><span begin="03:55.935" end="03:56.342">な</span><span begin="03:56.342" end="03:56.715">も</span><span begin="03:56.715" end="03:56.968">の</span><span begin="03:56.968" end="03:58.369">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是呢，说来也奇妙</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">demo ne fushigi na mono ne</span></p><p begin="03:58.717" end="04:01.973" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61"><span begin="03:58.717" end="03:58.994">思</span><span begin="03:58.994" end="03:59.358">い</span><span begin="03:59.358" end="03:59.668">返</span><span begin="03:59.668" end="03:59.882">し</span><span begin="03:59.882" end="04:00.214">て</span><span begin="04:00.214" end="04:00.622">み</span><span begin="04:00.622" end="04:00.838">れ</span><span begin="04:00.838" end="04:01.973">ば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仔细回想的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">omoikaeshite mireba</span></p><p begin="04:02.196" end="04:11.540" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62"><span begin="04:02.196" end="04:02.498">い</span><span begin="04:02.498" end="04:02.764">つ</span><span begin="04:02.764" end="04:03.156">の</span><span begin="04:03.156" end="04:03.564">間</span><span begin="04:03.564" end="04:03.797">に</span><span begin="04:03.797" end="04:04.311">か</span><span begin="04:04.311" end="04:04.524">ちょ</span><span begin="04:04.524" end="04:04.777">っ</span><span begin="04:04.777" end="04:05.494">と</span><span begin="04:05.494" end="04:05.765">さ</span><span begin="04:05.765" end="04:06.222">わ</span><span begin="04:06.222" end="04:06.473">が</span><span begin="04:06.473" end="04:06.740">し</span><span begin="04:06.740" end="04:07.113">く</span><span begin="04:07.113" end="04:07.504">な</span><span begin="04:07.504" end="04:07.715">っ</span><span begin="04:07.715" end="04:08.224">た…</span><span begin="04:08.224" end="04:08.529">か</span><span begin="04:08.529" end="04:08.708">も</span><span begin="04:08.708" end="04:11.540">ね。</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知不觉间，似乎稍微变得喧闹了一些……也许吧。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itsu no ma ni ka chotto sawagashiku natta... kamo ne.</span></p><p begin="04:23.561" end="04:27.687" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63"><span begin="04:23.561" end="04:23.808">何</span><span begin="04:23.808" end="04:24.060">も</span><span begin="04:24.060" end="04:24.292">約</span><span begin="04:24.292" end="04:24.771">束</span><span begin="04:24.771" end="04:25.285">す</span><span begin="04:25.285" end="04:25.621">る</span><span begin="04:25.621" end="04:25.995">こ</span><span begin="04:25.995" end="04:26.261">と</span><span begin="04:26.261" end="04:26.494">な</span><span begin="04:26.494" end="04:26.746">ん</span><span begin="04:26.746" end="04:26.940">て</span><span begin="04:26.940" end="04:27.071">な</span><span begin="04:27.071" end="04:27.687">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有任何需要约定的事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nani mo yakusoku suru koto nante nai</span></p><p begin="04:28.189" end="04:31.093" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L64"><span begin="04:28.189" end="04:28.441">契</span><span begin="04:28.441" end="04:28.674">り</span><span begin="04:28.674" end="04:28.921">を</span><span begin="04:28.921" end="04:29.939">結</span><span begin="04:29.939" end="04:30.191">ぶ</span><span begin="04:30.191" end="04:30.404">こ</span><span begin="04:30.404" end="04:30.637">と</span><span begin="04:30.637" end="04:30.870">も</span><span begin="04:30.870" end="04:30.981">な</span><span begin="04:30.981" end="04:31.093">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也不必立下什么誓约</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">chigiri o musubu koto mo nai</span></p><p begin="04:31.373" end="04:35.509" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L65"><span begin="04:31.373" end="04:31.664">な</span><span begin="04:31.664" end="04:31.803">ぜ</span><span begin="04:31.803" end="04:31.878">っ</span><span begin="04:31.878" end="04:32.110">て</span><span begin="04:32.110" end="04:32.358">そ</span><span begin="04:32.358" end="04:32.629">ん</span><span begin="04:32.629" end="04:32.862">な</span><span begin="04:32.862" end="04:33.095">の</span><span begin="04:33.095" end="04:33.366">ぜ</span><span begin="04:33.366" end="04:33.512">ん</span><span begin="04:33.512" end="04:33.793">ぜ</span><span begin="04:33.793" end="04:34.065">ん</span><span begin="04:34.065" end="04:34.297">意</span><span begin="04:34.297" end="04:34.530">味</span><span begin="04:34.530" end="04:34.709">が</span><span begin="04:34.709" end="04:34.835">な</span><span begin="04:34.835" end="04:35.509">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为那种东西完全没有意义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">naze tte sonna no zenzen imi ga nai</span></p><p begin="04:35.999" end="04:39.138" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L66"><span begin="04:35.999" end="04:36.246">い</span><span begin="04:36.246" end="04:36.483">つ</span><span begin="04:36.483" end="04:36.750">の</span><span begin="04:36.750" end="04:36.983">間</span><span begin="04:36.983" end="04:37.322">に</span><span begin="04:37.322" end="04:37.657">や</span><span begin="04:37.657" end="04:37.909">ら</span><span begin="04:37.909" end="04:38.110">関</span><span begin="04:38.110" end="04:38.465">係</span><span begin="04:38.465" end="04:38.732">な</span><span begin="04:38.732" end="04:39.138">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知不觉间已经无所谓了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itsu no ma ni yara kankei nai</span></p><p begin="04:39.180" end="04:39.868" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L67"><span begin="04:39.180" end="04:39.412">だ</span><span begin="04:39.412" end="04:39.543">か</span><span begin="04:39.543" end="04:39.670">ら</span><span begin="04:39.670" end="04:39.868">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dakara ne</span></p><p begin="04:39.989" end="04:43.311" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L68"><span begin="04:39.989" end="04:40.208">い</span><span begin="04:40.208" end="04:40.441">つ</span><span begin="04:40.441" end="04:40.620">も</span><span begin="04:40.620" end="04:40.887">の</span><span begin="04:40.887" end="04:41.224">よ</span><span begin="04:41.224" end="04:41.600">う</span><span begin="04:41.600" end="04:41.866">に</span><span begin="04:41.866" end="04:42.031">邪</span><span begin="04:42.031" end="04:42.332">魔</span><span begin="04:42.332" end="04:42.545">さ</span><span begin="04:42.545" end="04:42.710">れ</span><span begin="04:42.710" end="04:43.311">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一如既往地被捣乱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itsumo no you ni jama sarete</span></p><p begin="04:43.702" end="04:46.564" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L69"><span begin="04:43.702" end="04:44.007">い</span><span begin="04:44.007" end="04:44.274">つ</span><span begin="04:44.274" end="04:44.491">も</span><span begin="04:44.491" end="04:44.739">の</span><span begin="04:44.739" end="04:45.078">よ</span><span begin="04:45.078" end="04:45.432">う</span><span begin="04:45.432" end="04:45.684">に</span><span begin="04:45.684" end="04:46.092">喧</span><span begin="04:46.092" end="04:46.344">嘩</span><span begin="04:46.344" end="04:46.489">し</span><span begin="04:46.489" end="04:46.564">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一如既往地吵架</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itsumo no you ni kenka shite</span></p><p begin="04:46.851" end="04:50.996" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L70"><span begin="04:46.851" end="04:47.103">そ</span><span begin="04:47.103" end="04:47.268">れ</span><span begin="04:47.268" end="04:47.359">で</span><span begin="04:47.359" end="04:47.627">も</span><span begin="04:47.627" end="04:47.913">い</span><span begin="04:47.913" end="04:48.165">つ</span><span begin="04:48.165" end="04:48.397">も</span><span begin="04:48.397" end="04:48.630">の</span><span begin="04:48.630" end="04:48.950">よ</span><span begin="04:48.950" end="04:49.338">う</span><span begin="04:49.338" end="04:49.571">に</span><span begin="04:49.571" end="04:49.871">や</span><span begin="04:49.871" end="04:50.032">っ</span><span begin="04:50.032" end="04:50.284">て</span><span begin="04:50.284" end="04:50.409">く</span><span begin="04:50.409" end="04:50.996">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此还是一如既往地找上门来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">soredemo itsumo no you ni yattekuru</span></p><p begin="04:51.470" end="04:54.458" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L71"><span begin="04:51.470" end="04:51.741">そ</span><span begin="04:51.741" end="04:52.008">う</span><span begin="04:52.008" end="04:52.240">い</span><span begin="04:52.240" end="04:52.507">う</span><span begin="04:52.507" end="04:52.866">こ</span><span begin="04:52.866" end="04:53.254">と</span><span begin="04:53.254" end="04:53.506">に</span><span begin="04:53.506" end="04:53.815">な</span><span begin="04:53.815" end="04:53.981">っ</span><span begin="04:53.981" end="04:54.199">て</span><span begin="04:54.199" end="04:54.330">い</span><span begin="04:54.330" end="04:54.458">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就是这么回事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sou iu koto ni natte iru</span></p><p begin="04:54.640" end="04:55.220" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L72"><span begin="04:54.640" end="04:54.888">そ</span><span begin="04:54.888" end="04:55.018">う</span><span begin="04:55.018" end="04:55.110">で</span><span begin="04:55.110" end="04:55.208">しょ</span><span begin="04:55.208" end="04:55.220">う？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">——对吧？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sou deshou?</span></p><p begin="04:55.528" end="04:58.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L73"><span begin="04:55.528" end="04:55.815">た</span><span begin="04:55.815" end="04:56.079">と</span><span begin="04:56.079" end="04:56.339">え</span><span begin="04:56.339" end="04:56.864">明</span><span begin="04:56.864" end="04:57.254">日</span><span begin="04:57.254" end="04:57.519">が</span><span begin="04:57.519" end="04:57.945">最</span><span begin="04:57.945" end="04:58.223">後</span><span begin="04:58.223" end="04:58.344">で</span><span begin="04:58.344" end="04:58.640">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕明天就是最后一天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tatoe ashita ga saigo demo</span></p><p begin="04:59.503" end="05:02.312" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L74"><span begin="04:59.503" end="04:59.960">今</span><span begin="04:59.960" end="05:00.449">生</span><span begin="05:00.449" end="05:00.991">の</span><span begin="05:00.991" end="05:01.462">別</span><span begin="05:01.462" end="05:01.727">れ</span><span begin="05:01.727" end="05:01.924">の</span><span begin="05:01.924" end="05:02.140">日</span><span begin="05:02.140" end="05:02.261">で</span><span begin="05:02.261" end="05:02.312">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕是今生诀别之日</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">konjou no wakare no hi demo</span></p><p begin="05:02.500" end="05:06.698" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L75"><span begin="05:02.500" end="05:02.567">あ</span><span begin="05:02.567" end="05:02.913">ん</span><span begin="05:02.913" end="05:03.033">た</span><span begin="05:03.033" end="05:03.348">は</span><span begin="05:03.348" end="05:03.868">何</span><span begin="05:03.868" end="05:04.114">も</span><span begin="05:04.114" end="05:04.361">気</span><span begin="05:04.361" end="05:04.675">に</span><span begin="05:04.675" end="05:05.065">せ</span><span begin="05:05.065" end="05:05.348">ず</span><span begin="05:05.348" end="05:05.594">や</span><span begin="05:05.594" end="05:05.841">っ</span><span begin="05:05.841" end="05:06.043">て</span><span begin="05:06.043" end="05:06.159">く</span><span begin="05:06.159" end="05:06.698">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你也会什么都不在意地跑来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">anta wa nani mo ki ni sezu yattekuru</span></p><p begin="05:07.301" end="05:10.264" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L76"><span begin="05:07.301" end="05:07.535">そ</span><span begin="05:07.535" end="05:07.781">う</span><span begin="05:07.781" end="05:08.014">い</span><span begin="05:08.014" end="05:08.279">う</span><span begin="05:08.279" end="05:08.590">こ</span><span begin="05:08.590" end="05:09.015">と</span><span begin="05:09.015" end="05:09.292">に</span><span begin="05:09.292" end="05:09.526">な</span><span begin="05:09.526" end="05:09.759">っ</span><span begin="05:09.759" end="05:09.974">て</span><span begin="05:09.974" end="05:10.091">い</span><span begin="05:10.091" end="05:10.264">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就是这么回事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sou iu koto ni natte iru</span></p><p begin="05:10.436" end="05:11.098" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L77"><span begin="05:10.436" end="05:10.503">そ</span><span begin="05:10.503" end="05:10.656">う</span><span begin="05:10.656" end="05:10.777">で</span><span begin="05:10.777" end="05:10.862">し</span><span begin="05:10.862" end="05:10.947">ょ</span><span begin="05:10.981" end="05:11.098">う？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">——对吧？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sou deshou?</span></p></div></body></tt>